<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκρί̄β-εια</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exactness, precision</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				1.22
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν πραχθέντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					4.3.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Lys.
				17.6
			</span></i>:— freq. with Preps. in adv. sense, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἀκριβείας</span>
			<i>with minuteness</i> or <i>precision</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				184c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				23d
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ πάσης ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Lg.</u>
					876c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τὴν ἀ. φιλοσοφεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Grg.</u>
					487c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1331a2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς τὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					769d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Resp.</u>
				478b1
			</span></i>:—<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀ. τοῦ
			ναυτικοῦ</span> its <i>efficiency, rigid discipline</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.13
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. νόμων</span>
			<i>strictness, severity</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				7.40
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ τὸ διάφορον</span>
			<i>strictness</i> in money matters <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				31
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				27.11
			</span></i>: pl., <i>niceties</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				504e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Is.
				7.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>parsimony, frugality</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Per.</u>
				16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ δι᾽ ἀκριβείας ἐστί
			τινι</span> is <i>scarce</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				844b
			</span></i>.</div>
